1
00:00:00,254 --> 00:00:02,674
- I don't know. Tell her I'm sick.
- Okay.

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:05,380
Not the kind that would make her
wanna take care of me.

3
00:00:05,551 --> 00:00:09,761
(Leonard:)But nothing so critical that she'll feel
uncomfortable if I wanna try this again.

4
00:00:09,931 --> 00:00:12,431
(Sheldon:)Got it. So I'm assuming nothing venereal.

5
00:00:17,105 --> 00:00:19,695
(Sheldon:)I'll just tell her that you had
a routine colonoscopy...

6
00:00:19,857 --> 00:00:21,697
(Sheldon:)...and haven't quite bounced back.

7
00:00:21,859 --> 00:00:24,239
- Give me the phone.
- I thought you wanted to cancel.

8
00:00:24,404 --> 00:00:27,244
I can't. If I don't show up,
she'll still be expecting you.

9
00:00:27,907 --> 00:00:29,787
(Sheldon:)Why would she be expecting me?

10
00:00:30,785 --> 00:00:34,835
(Leonard:)Stop asking me all these questions.
I need to take another shower.

11
00:00:38,084 --> 00:00:40,754
(Penny:)- Are the rest of the guys meeting us here?
- Oh, yeah.

12
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,250
(Leonard:)No.

13
00:00:42,839 --> 00:00:44,839
(Leonard:)Turns out that Raj and Howard
had to work...

14
00:00:45,008 --> 00:00:50,468
(Leonard:)...and Sheldon had a colonoscopy,
and he hasn't quite bounced back yet.

15
00:00:51,431 --> 00:00:53,721
(Penny:)Ooh, my uncle just had
a colonoscopy.

16
00:00:53,891 --> 00:00:57,981
(Leonard:)You're kidding. Well, then,
that's something we have in common.

17
00:00:58,521 --> 00:01:00,231
(Penny:)How?

